feedback.body:
With
```
struct calPoint {
    uint32_t freq;
    uint16_t loPwr;
    uint16_t hiPwr:
};
```
this becomes

```suggestion
struct C62BandCalib {
    struct calPoint points[C62_CAL_POINTS];
    uint8_t points;
};
```
Which is easier to handle, because you can then do `calib.points[i].hiPwr ...`

