replies.body:
Fixed with latest commit. Adding a comma was not sufficient to make clang-format break the struct out onto multiple lines. I had to revise it to:

```diff

-        uint32_t long_press : 1,
-                 keys       : 29,
-                 _padding   : 2;
+       uint32_t long_press : 1;
+       uint32_t keys       : 29;
+       uint32_t _padding   : 2;
```

The explicit definition of each member on a separate line got clang-format to go along with it. I wasn't able to do it with just commas for some reason.

