The PR is good, there are just a couple of minimal things that need improvement.
Speaking about the feature itself, I'm unsure whether to add it or not to the codebase: at the moment only the CS7000 Plus will have it, and not all the CS7000P devices in the wild actually have the vibration motor. To me, it seems to be more like a "corporate" feature like man-down detection and not something really ham-radio related, but opinions are welcome.
@mdiepart @turnrye what do you think?

